%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4877fb6ffc62fe90d83c8e4d3d4cb55f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 07_Chapter7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryData
  storyId: story_main_07
  storyName: Business as Usual
  storyDescription: 'Trady opens her shop. Reward: free Coins and Shop items.'
  chapterLabel: CHAPTER 7
  previousStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b2b20b1b20889d1c885487efbc334c35, type: 2}
  requiredLevel: {fileID: 0}
  storyPrefab: {fileID: 0}
  segments:
  - type: 0
    lines:
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: After the encounter, the group reaches a more populated area.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 1
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Unlike the previous locations, this place has some kind of organized
        activity. Concept Spirits walk around, exchange goods, and gather near several
        shops.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Finally. Somewhere that looks somewhat normal.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: NORMAL?! THIS PLACE IS NEVER NORMAL!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Compared to some other areas, this is relatively peaceful.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2427568e74d898eb2a009073ab81c9c4, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: There are many Concept Spirits here.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Do they all live here?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Not necessarily. Concept World is not organized like the human world.
        Some Spirits gather in particular areas because of their conceptual relationships.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: So this place is more like a gathering point?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f030c5b604997dacfaea867d37529fce, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You could say that.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: What's that building?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: OH!!! THAT'S A SHOP!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: A shop?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: YES!!! YOU CAN BUY THINGS THERE!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I know what a shop is.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5a4c2003775679f7b6197557d77e1fb, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: GREAT!!! THEN YOU KNOW WHAT TO DO!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Well, well. Look who's still standing! Welcome to my shop, Your Majesty!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You run a shop?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Naturally! Someone has to make a profit around here.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Do you always charge people for everything?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Of course not! Sometimes I charge them for things they don't even know
        they need.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEY! THAT'S MY LINE!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: You wouldn't know a good business opportunity if it hit you in the face.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I KNOW GAMBLING!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Exactly my point.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...You two are related, aren't you?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Unfortunately.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: HEY!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I see.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Anyway, Your Majesty, you seem to be in need of supplies.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I don't have much money.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Oh, don't worry. Consider this an investment in a potential future customer.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: SHE'S GIVING AWAY FREE STUFF?!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Some Coins and samples on the house. Go try buying something!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: ...You're giving me money?
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Think of it as a welcome gift.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 0}
      speakerName: Fajar
      rightSide: 0
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: That's surprisingly generous.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: Don't get used to it.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: SHE'S NICE SOMETIMES!!!
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    - style: 0
      speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
      speakerName: 
      rightSide: 1
      label: 
      heading: 
      text: I can still hear you.
      blackScreen: 0
      background: {fileID: 0}
      effect: 0
    level: {fileID: 0}
    team: []
    scriptedLoss: 0
    scriptedLossSeconds: 45
    battleToasts: []
  background: {fileID: 2365596823942982563, guid: 2131dec12abd08c9aabdc9c28f88f2f1,
    type: 3}
  storyRewards: []
  rewardEntries:
  - reward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ca045a363525551379ed4a6e01ed1d9d, type: 2}
    amount: 5000
  - reward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7f10a0a4c87a2d5892f1a7d6bdb4663, type: 2}
    amount: 20
  - reward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7b1e503074c0e22ba8291973dc096bc4, type: 2}
    amount: 20
  - reward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 35922ea8f99da01adb6e1fb0f904baab, type: 2}
    amount: 20
  nextStory: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e37f85c34b98be2d5b320c70fd1d9919, type: 2}
  afterScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d23eab0e998ddf54aacae1b3dea3e23d, type: 2}
  afterSceneToasts:
  - time: 1.5
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Tap an item to view its details.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.3
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Confirm your purchase to exchange Coins for the item.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.3
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Dust and Engrams can be used to strengthen your characters.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.8
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: Spare Dust and Engrams can also be converted here.
    duration: 4.5
  - time: 0.3
    trigger: 0
    notBefore: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    text: WHEN YOU'RE DONE, HEAD BACK TO THE MAIN MENU!!!
    duration: 4.5
  afterGachaPullToasts: []
  afterAction: 1
  afterActionToasts: []
  followUpLines:
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: So this is how you trade here.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Precisely. Everything has value. The trick is knowing what to exchange
      and when.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: And what's your trick?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Making sure the other person thinks they're getting the better deal.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: That doesn't sound very honest.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Honesty is important. Profit is also important.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: SHE'S JUST SAYING SHE WANTS MONEY!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: And you're saying that as if you don't.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: I WANT MORE MONEY!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Exactly my point.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: I think I'll leave before this turns into another argument.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Aww, leaving already?
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: Fajar
    rightSide: 0
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: I have other things to do.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Very well. Come back whenever you need supplies, Your Majesty.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8dd8fff2790dd37228cfea376b6e24d5, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: AND COME BACK WHEN YOU WANT TO GAMBLE!!!
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  - style: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f84f736e81305891196beccef0305ec9, type: 2}
    speakerName: 
    rightSide: 1
    label: 
    heading: 
    text: Please stop calling it that.
    blackScreen: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    effect: 0
  timeLimitSeconds: 600
  storyMusic: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d8bb118ed9afc98ecb6078abc6c0d285, type: 2}
